WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
My name is Jaikumari and I am from Samstipur district. I am studying in class 9c.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
My father used to work here and he liked this school.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
He brought us here. I felt difficult at first but I kept on living here.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
I liked the environment here.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Thanks for watching.
